# Ciudad Cenit, south half (C6, contract 49), 34 x 16. column = i, row = j. The SOUTH half of the city (see `ciudad_cenit` for the split): the Fighting dojo (door (6,4)), the psychic gym (door (26,4), open from the start),
# the mime trader's house (door (15,10): a creature trade), the EAST gate (33,7..8) from Ruta 8 and the SOUTH gate (16..17,15) from Ruta 6; the gap (16..17,0) leads back to the north half. Same look.
@map ciudad_cenit_sur
@size 34 16
@interior no
@area ciudad_cenit
@bg 0
@fill ring_00
@spawn north 16 1 S
@spawn south 16 14 N
@spawn east 32 7 W
@spawn dojo_door 6 5 S
@spawn gym_door 26 5 S
@spawn mimo_door 15 11 S
@legend
